    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Dr. Eugene Jordan served Cleveland and East Cleveland through dental care, civil-rights work, education, and professional leadership. He expanded access to quality care for people who could not afford it, became president of the National Dental Association, mentored students, taught Black history, and supported African American community advancement."
    ]
